    {
      "content": "## Kubernetes 集群整体健康总览\n\n数据来源：**kube-state-metrics + kubelet/cAdvisor + Kubernetes 控制面指标**\n\n当前筛选：`$namespace / $node`　｜　建议先观察红色状态卡，再下钻到节点、Pod 和工作负载面板。\n\n> API Server 面板无数据时，需检查 kube-prometheus-stack 是否成功抓取 kube-apiserver。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "mode": "markdown",
      "options": {
